    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d126">

                <pb facs="0298" n="126" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg126"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/3291</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Droppers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-10T20:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 10, 1917, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 11, 7.30
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>251. Replying to your circular telegram 4th [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >3d</hi>].<anchor n="2" xml:id="d126-f1"/> Greek Government shares
                    President’s solicitude for world peace and safety of <pb facs="0299" n="127"
                        xml:id="pg127"/> seas. Has formulated “express reserves” to German
                    Government in regard to latter’s blockade plans, but in view of peculiar
                    situation of Greece at this time can not take united action with American
                    Government. Text of reply to be forwarded by mail.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d126-f2"
                    />
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Droppers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
